      "value": "<p>Immediately after you cast a Sorcerer spell with a spell slot, you can create an effect of your choice from the @UUID[Compendium.dnd-players-handbook.tables.RollTable.phbWildMagicSurg]{Wild Magic Surge} table instead of rolling on that table. You can choose any effect in the table except for the final row, and if the chosen effect involves a roll, you must make it.</p><p>Once you use this feature, you can’t do so again until you finish a Long Rest.</p>",
